	column _!OnTimeDate = ```
			
			        IF (
			            RELATED('Measures (2)'[Use ]) = "First Date",
			            '0125'[First Date],
			            IF (
			                RELATED('Measures (2)'[Use ]) = "Planning End",
			                '0125'[Planning end],
			                IF (
			                    RELATED('Measures (2)'[Use ]) = "Requested deliv.date",
			                    '0125'[Requested deliv.date],
			                    IF (
			                        RELATED('Measures (2)'[Use ]) = "Planned date CheckIn",
			                        '0125'[Planned date CheckIn],
			                        IF ( RELATED('Measures (2)'[Use ]) = "Guarantee Date", '0125'[Guarantee Date])
			                )
			            )
			        )
			    )
			```
		dataType: dateTime
		formatString: Short Date
		lineageTag: 4015167c-07f0-4f10-a73d-edcca8a5f6f8
		summarizeBy: none

